    {"id":"tips.power_controls","en":"Hold [tcol=FFE399]Powers[/tcol] to access the power tree.\r\rPress [tcol=FFE399]Use Power[/tcol] with the power bar open to use a power directly without changing which is active.\r\rYou can toggle in and out of dialogue mode without ending the conversation by pressing [tcol=FFE399]Talk[/tcol].","zh":"按住[tcol=FFE399]异能[/tcol]可打开异能树。\r\r打开异能栏时，按下[tcol=FFE399]施放异能[/tcol]可直接使用异能，而不改变当前选中的异能。\r\r按下[tcol=FFE399]交谈[/tcol]可进入或退出对话模式，交谈本身不会因此结束。"}
